Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哈 这里和Build Base一样的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊 好吵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是个难看的老头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 司马博士 欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去还是老样子 真精神呢 大利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美和也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那边那个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大利所长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来 就只有我们几个变老了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿的话 博士 您看上去很精神的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的重力 可是长寿的秘诀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事不宜迟 看一下这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月球的背面 308号环形山的附近 有着类似铜铎的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是远远超出我们所知的铜铎的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这反应...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大铜铎!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:02:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妃魅祸陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两座铜铎的共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能将长眠于此的伟大力量 收归本尊之手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今 再也没有本尊实现不了的愿望了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古老的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通往一切的冥府之路 黄泉比良坡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开辟此路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP:STORMBRINGER\NBy:JAM Project
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,変幻自在 天魔外道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闇の気配が迫る
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問答無用 情け無用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一気にけりを着けろ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇跡のPower
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怒りのSoul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WOWOW WOWOW
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嵐とともに
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷鳴の中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,変われ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神になれ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叩きつけろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,その拳を
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打つ砕け!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悪の野望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:15.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗黒の雲を吹き祓え!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吠えろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来の空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限りない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢をのせて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒れ果てた世界に希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古の神の技に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熱い勇気を込めて!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強の化身は 立つ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字幕制作：(V2,林原萌,Hikaru,Wesley)@X2字幕组\N抄写重调：cavalier@u2.dmhy.org
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终决战!\N大铜铎 升起!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我白担心了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是司马迁次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的同胞们 感谢各位的支援
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要进入月球的旋转轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算没法变成基克 我们也绝不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.87,0:05:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,望各位奋力拼搏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员 出击
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 不知天高地厚的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全机 攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊来啊来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月面出现异常强烈的铜铎反应
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备浮出地面了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:55.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是追赶本尊至此的奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是啥呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的母舰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要大意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那里探测出了高能量反应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大铜铎就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各机 警戒从敌母舰发射的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏力竟然如此巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快回避
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这力量 不过是本尊所得力量的一鳞半爪罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大铜铎就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可没法接近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得想办法解决那条光柱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要胆怯啊 小子们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着我上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Big Shooter的位置在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然悬于敌母舰上空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那能量炮太棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大利 那个东西如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Overcross Blaster吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经开发完成了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Overcross Blaster 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射击阵型 完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标 敌母舰能量柱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量柱 破坏成功
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在 赶快突入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.93,0:09:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里面就是终点了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:29.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少给我得意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来迎接我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才有趣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Big Shooter 我们来开道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请笔直前进
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trinity Attack 上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trinity Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽耍些小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要小看Build Angel啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可不能在这儿就被干掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 自导引导弹 发射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下个弯道 Guard&Run
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弯道? 是拐角的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙也是赛车手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转移到雷钢马上去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一到达目的地就把你们放下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的岩石啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就是 天岩户啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那里面能够感受到强烈的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来是来了 这面岩石 可不是那么容易就能移开的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑着雷钢马直接冲进去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少说蠢话了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算雷钢马再硬...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么大块岩石 你也会被
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 头盔怎么...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是精神世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妃魅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不能让你破坏它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然没法变成基克
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但对付你们 凭我的拳头就足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 埴轮幻神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有任何胜算就跑进来 又有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再愚蠢也该有个限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两座铜铎将这艘船中长眠的力量变为本尊的了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜铎已经完成了使命 正逐渐消失呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的傻笑也到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从来就没有凭胜算在战斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才不会输的 你这混蛋决不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正是抱着这份意念才咬住你不放的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妃魅祸 我们一定要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决不能让你再横行霸道下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少狂妄了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再让你碰椿一根手指头的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这黄泉比良坡早已是本尊的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭你们能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是约定过了的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和镜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和椿的外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 也是和我自己约定好了的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就去地狱 实现你的约定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿 由我来保护
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少自大了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然抵达此地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:14:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尔等却是永远无法理解此地的意义 铜铎为何物的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里灭亡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正是你和椿携手之时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你们理解其真正意义之时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一定能冲破难关的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们的所有力量 源自精神能源 即 诞生于咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把憎恶 怨恨等等负面情感实体化 并转化为她们的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人的意念 并不只是诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会打倒你 然后回家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和椿一起 回到我们的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本尊的目标只有彼地 可没时间与蝼蚁浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尔等就和此地一同终结吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将意念化为实体的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我所继承的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜铎回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下就能变回基克了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快上来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口被...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我方兵力已损失60%
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄罗斯队 陷没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利队 正不断发送SOS信号
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷光特殊部队 全灭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.29,0:16:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要打乱队列
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 轮到我出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打死你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 不肯让我变成基克吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩 抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 没空气的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Change Cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司马宙 你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再挣扎了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会将你们全灭得干干净净
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那正是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪魔大王国 你们才该全灭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了 宙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 美和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基克部件 Setup! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢铁基克!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要摩托的啊 真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿 我们也上咯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上咯 剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基克部件 Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢铁基克!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基克竟然有两架
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他们的血来祭旗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了 剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Dynamite Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jeeg Beem
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猛攻 地狱掌击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Magenet Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基基基克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:20:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 Dynamite Kick
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢踢我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连妃魅祸陛下都还不肯踢我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打倒基克了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.51,0:21:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Double Spin Storm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.37,0:21:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 妃魅祸陛...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来 是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待续
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ending Theme [HEAVEN]\Nby GRANRODEO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't let me down Don't leave me now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手探りの　in the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Right on my way, Light out the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见失わないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:23:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,キラメキを背にして　立ち上がる君はconfuse
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歩き始めるとまどいも 腕に抱えて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,cause I fly away to heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.57,0:23:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命が见えた 足りない意思の果てに　
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when I find your any reason
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:29.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁が为に问う stair way to heaven 理想へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,登る世界は???yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I keep freak out forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有什么好不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的回答
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.60,0:23:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化为钢铁神!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
